      "questionId": "qe-c04-0076",
      "sentenceId": "c04-s06-p041-05932-s009",
      "sentenceText": "So she went on to explain: she became a surrogate mother (gestational carrier) for her daughter and son-in-law, meaning she was impregnated through the use of in vitro fertilization (IVF) with her son-in-law’s sperm and daughter’s eggs when she was fifty-two and fifty-five!",
